    {
      "id": 15,
      "name": {
        "name": "Accessibility Guide"
      },
      "notes": {
        "notes": "Accessibility Demo template — every control is LIVE.\nPress Play: sliders and toggles apply immediately via AccessibilityDemo.as.\nNavigate with Tab/Shift+Tab, arrows, or gamepad DPad; Enter/Space activates.\nColorblind Mode slider: 0=Off through 7=Achromatopsia (watch the swatch cubes).\nReduced Motion stops the spinning cube (SpinningCube.as checks the setting).\nScreen Reader announcements appear in the status bar; in browser exports\nthey are spoken aloud via the Web Speech API.\nThis scene doubles as the website's browser demo."
      },
